{"id":"076e69cbf2d46206","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-provability-sigma1.md","title":"fact-provability-sigma1 — Provability Predicate Sigma1","display":"fact-provability-sigma1 — Provability Predicate Sigma1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-provability-sigma1","aliases":["92-fact-provability-sigma1"],"display":"fact-provability-sigma1 — Provability Predicate Sigma1","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-fact-prf-decidable]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-provability-sigma1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-provability-sigma1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-provability-sigma1 — Provability Predicate Sigma1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5984f0527f1f4cba\" href=\"?note=5984f0527f1f4cba\" title=\"92-fact-prf-decidable\">92-fact-prf-decidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-provability-sigma1-—-Provability-Predicate-is-$\\Sigma_1$\">fact-provability-sigma1 — Provability Predicate is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (the internal formula representing the external relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variables and substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (arithmetical hierarchy classes)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}provability\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)=\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,v_0,v_0)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}provability\\text{-}sigma1}\\vdash\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)=\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,v_0,v_0)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> : 存在量词层级</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span>断言“存在一个证明码，其结论码为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>”</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>是外部数值关系，只有带点的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span>才是可属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span>并出现在对象语言量词下的公式</li>\n<li>在固定的标准算术化中，若证明检查由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span>公式正确表示，则结论成立；外部关系仅仅可判定并不靠排版自动产生这个内部公式</li>\n<li>给该公式添加一个无界存在量词块，得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span>公式</li>\n<li>这给出所选标准可证性公式的层级上界，不声称任意扩展等价公式都具有相同的字面复杂度</li>\n<li>GL公理<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box\\varphi \\to \\varphi) \\to \\Box\\varphi\">\\(\\Box(\\Box\\varphi \\to \\varphi) \\to \\Box\\varphi\\)</span>与此相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-provability-sigma1-—-Provability-Predicate-is-$\\Sigma_1$","text":"fact-provability-sigma1 — Provability Predicate is $\\Sigma_1$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text